{"type":"example","type_name":"Example","number":"","title":"A factor that explains a regressor","title_html":"A factor that explains a regressor","html":"<p>Grunfeld’s panel (<span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"exm-proj-grunfeld\">@exm-proj-grunfeld</span>) has <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"220\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>220</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> firm-years of gross investment,\nmarket value and capital stock for <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"11\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>11</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> firms. Regress investment on value,\ncapital and the firm, entered as <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"10\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>\nindicator columns with the first firm as reference. The generalized\nfactors are</p>\n<table>\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 21%\">\n<col style=\"width: 26%\">\n<col style=\"width: 26%\">\n<col style=\"width: 26%\">\n</colgroup>\n<thead>\n<tr class=\"header\">\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">Term</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: center;\">columns <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"q\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45E TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span></th>\n<th style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\text{GVIF}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c47\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c56\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c49\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c46\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>GVIF</mtext></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span></th>\n<th style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\text{GVIF}^{1/(2q)}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-msup><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c47\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c56\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c49\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c46\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.432em;\"><mjx-TeXAtom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2F\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></